WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.428
Vinnie and Magua returned to the village.

2
00:00:03.429 --> 00:00:06.404
They had caught plenty of fish.

3
00:00:06.405 --> 00:00:11.343
Families were gathering for the Corn Festival dances.

4
00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.067
Everyone was celebrating!

5
00:00:14.068 --> 00:00:17.604
"Come, Vinnie, we must eat," said Magua.

6
00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:21.001
Baskets of food were passed around.

7
00:00:21.002 --> 00:00:23.207
"This is great!"

8
00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:26.153
Vinnie bit into some corn bread.

9
00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:30.184
He also had some corn soup and roasted corn.

10
00:00:30.185 --> 00:00:32.937
He was so hungry!

11
00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:36.008
Suddenly, Magua groaned.

12
00:00:36.009 --> 00:00:38.007
He held his stomach.

13
00:00:38.008 --> 00:00:41.006
"What’s the matter?" asked Vinnie.

14
00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:45.014
"I feel sick," Magua said weakly.

15
00:00:45.015 --> 00:00:48.023
Clan Mother walked over to them.

16
00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:51.722
"What’s the matter, Magua?" she asked.

17
00:00:51.723 --> 00:00:53.884
Vinnie explained.

18
00:00:53.885 --> 00:00:57.204
"Call the healers," she ordered.

19
00:00:57.205 --> 00:01:01.344
"Bring them to my house."

20
00:01:01.345 --> 00:01:06.958
Inside the longhouse, Magua lay on a bed by the wall.

21
00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:11.112
Soon, Vinnie heard strange noises.

22
00:01:11.113 --> 00:01:14.601
People were shaking rattles and chanting.

23
00:01:14.602 --> 00:01:17.778
"What’s that?" he asked.

24
00:01:17.779 --> 00:01:21.812
"The healers are here," Clan Mother said.

25
00:01:21.813 --> 00:01:26.321
Vinnie heard scratching sounds at the door.

26
00:01:26.322 --> 00:01:28.677
Clan Mother let them in.

27
00:01:28.678 --> 00:01:33.349
People wearing ugly masks danced into the room.

28
00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.879
Vinnie almost screamed.

29
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:38.876
The carved masks were scary.

30
00:01:38.877 --> 00:01:43.010
A large tongue hung out of the mouth of one mask.

31
00:01:43.011 --> 00:01:48.602
The healers called out in screeching voices and jumped around.

32
00:01:48.603 --> 00:01:50.646
Vinnie was afraid.

33
00:01:50.647 --> 00:01:53.937
But Magua did not look frightened.

34
00:01:53.938 --> 00:01:56.285
He only looked sick.

35
00:01:56.286 --> 00:01:59.341
The masked group came closer.

36
00:01:59.342 --> 00:02:02.630
They threw ashes on Magua.

37
00:02:02.631 --> 00:02:07.136
They leaned over him and chanted louder.

38
00:02:07.137 --> 00:02:11.962
"Stay away! He’s my friend!" Vinnie

39
